Pick-up instructions at Melbourne Airport (shuttle)
- After collecting your luggage, call 07 3006 7442 (international: +61 7 3006 7442) for shuttle collection. If you can’t reach them, proceed to the “Hotel and Off-Airport Buses” area and wait for the Skypark shuttle van.
